# XSH geteuid()
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XSH.geteuid.001
anchor     functions/geteuid.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/geteuid.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
since      1988
says       In a child of a privileged test, geteuid() returns 65534 after
           seteuid(65534) (the real user ID staying 0) and 0 again after
           seteuid(0).
needs      root
note       The IDs are set in the setup phase with seteuid(); the child is
           UNRESOLVED when the system does not let it make those changes.
test       t/001-effective.c

assertion  XSH.geteuid.002
anchor     functions/geteuid.html#DESCRIPTION
class      required
since      2008
says       geteuid() leaves errno as it was (two different values tried).
test       t/002-errno.c
